    "name": "Grimgrad",
    "steam_appid": 1837340,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.poster.avif?t=1746526625\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.webm?t=1746526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.mp4?t=1746526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Try to survive the hardships of the Middle Ages and not anger the gods. A story campaign about Slavic deities and Survival mode. Lay roads, organize the mining and production of resources, and follow the needs of villagers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to start playing, even if you are new to city-building games.<br></li><li>Defeat pestilence, dirt, hunger, predators and weather while creating a comfortable environment for the villagers.<br></li><li>Issue decrees and solve problems, such as a fire in a bakery or a pestilence in a residential area.<br></li><li>Lots of random events. Your decisions have consequences.<br></li><li>Slavic gods and creatures from folklore. Try to propitiate them and choose the right decision.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.poster.avif?t=1746526625\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.webm?t=1746526625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1837340/extras/98ca39b073c6021630dcbfc385099d5c.mp4?t=1746526625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Try to survive the hardships of the Middle Ages and not anger the gods. A story campaign about Slavic deities and Survival mode. Lay roads, organize the mining and production of resources, and follow the needs of villagers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Easy to start playing, even if you are new to city-building games.<br></li><li>Defeat pestilence, dirt, hunger, predators and weather while creating a comfortable environment for the villagers.<br></li><li>Issue decrees and solve problems, such as a fire in a bakery or a pestilence in a residential area.<br></li><li>Lots of random events. Your decisions have consequences.<br></li><li>Slavic gods and creatures from folklore. Try to propitiate them and choose the right decision.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build your own Slavic settlement. Overcome the hardships of medieval life and don't anger the Gods!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Spanish - Spain, German, Simplified Chinese, French",
